NOTICE
======

This repository documents and modifies a Comgrow / Sovol SH03 filament dryer.
It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Comgrow, Sovol, or
GigaDevice.

No vendor firmware is distributed here
--------------------------------------

This repository contains **no copy of the dryer's firmware**. What it ships is
`firmware/patch_sh03.py` — an original script that applies 48 bytes of changes
to a firmware dump that the user makes from their own device. That patch is the
author's own work, provided to enable interoperability (controlling the dryer
from Home Assistant).

The stock firmware the patch targets remains the manufacturer's code. Running
the script grants no rights to it, and if you redistribute a *patched image*,
that image contains the manufacturer's code.

